	measure 'Copilot Top Function' = ```
			
			  VAR _FunctionUsers = SUMMARIZE(
			    'public v_dim_pbi_copilot_list',
			    'public v_dim_pbi_copilot_list'[Function],
			    "User Count", COUNT('public v_dim_pbi_copilot_list'[itcode])
			  )
			  // Get the function with the most users
			  VAR _TopFunction = TOPN(
			    1,
			    _FunctionUsers,
			    [User Count],
			    DESC
			  )
			  RETURN MAXX(_TopFunction, [Function])
			```
